  "body": "Skip to content\nHome\nAbout Us\nServices\nProjects\nGalleries\nContact\nYour First Step\nQuality assured plastering and rendering\n\nWe provide a wide range of plastering and rendering services to domestic and commercial customers in Banstead, Cheam, Sutton, Wallington, Worcester Park and surrounding areas.\n\nAll disciplines of internal & external plastering and rendering undertaken, from patch repairs to skimming damaged or cracked walls and ceilings, to renovations and new builds, coving and Tacking, or Dot and Dab. No job is too small.\n\nWe pride ourselves on our high quality finished work, professional working practices and highly competitive rates. We provide free estimates on request.\n\n I’ve been a builder for many years and never have I seen such good plasterers.  Clean, efficient and very approachable.\nPlastering\n\nWe undertake all aspects of plastering from small repairs to complete renovations. We deal with all types of property regardless of age or condition.\n\nRendering\n\nRendering is a very important part of your property, not only will it protect against damp penetration but it can greatly enhance the atheistic appearance.\n\nTacking Dot & Dab\n\nWe can plasterboard walls and ceilings or simply a small area as part of a plaster repair, an alternative to traditional sand and cement or wet plaster finish\n\nOur Projects\n\nView a range of projects we have recently completed locally. A selection of works in plastering, rendering, dry lining, coving and floor screeding. \n\nDamp Proof Course in Worcester Park\nRead More »\nDamp Proofing in Cheam: Case Study\nRead More »\nOriel Window Repairs in Raynes Park: Case Study\nRead More »\nDamp Repairs in Cheam: Case Study\nRead More »\nContact Us\n\nJohn Dwyer T/A Cheam Plastering\n16 The Dene\nCheam\nSM2 7EG\nTel: 020 8770 9482\nMobile: 07957 613 796\nEmail: [REDACTED_EMAIL]\n\nA company you can trust\nComplaints Procedure\nPrivacy & Cookie Policy\nEthically Conscious\n© 2025 Cheam Plastering • Design by VWD\nThis website uses cookies to improve your experience. We'll assume you're ok with this, but you can opt-out if you wish. Cookie settingsACCEPT",
